          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Project Review & Assurance</h3>
        <p>
          Independent technical review, risk assessment, and assurance services to support decision-making across project delivery and operational change.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div>
        Enquiries: <a href="mailto:colebournconsulting@gmail.com">colebournconsulting@gmail.com</a>
      </div>
      <div>&copy; <script>document.write(new Date().getFullYear())</script> Colebourn Consulting</div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
